  "content": "\n\n# Tschipcraft 的出生动画\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/spawnanimations/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Tschipcraft/spawnanimations?colorA=151513&colorB=e3e1ce&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub stars\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spawn-animations-mod\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1223719?label=CurseForge&colorA=151513&colorB=e3e1ce&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/spawnanimations/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tschipcraft/spawnanimations/total?logo=github&colorA=151513&colorB=e3e1ce&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub downloads\"></a>\n\n> 适用于 1.14.x-26.2.x 的服务器端数据包/模组\n\n<h2><img align=\"left\" alt=\"🧟‍♂️\" width=\"28\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/misode/mcmeta/refs/heads/assets/assets/minecraft/textures/item/zombie_spawn_egg.png\"> ‌‌ 功能</h2>\n\n敌对生物在出生时会从地下破土而出或化作一团烟雾凭空出现。\n\n**支持以下生物：**\n僵尸、尸壳、溺尸、骷髅、流浪者、沼泽骷髅、凋灵骷髅、蜘蛛、洞穴蜘蛛、苦力怕、末影人、史莱姆、岩浆怪、僵尸疣猪兽、炽足兽和巨人。\n\n该数据包/模组旨在尽可能减少干扰。被隐藏的实体（包括其穿戴的护甲和手持物品）将仅处于不可见且无声状态。\n\n出生动画完全基于服务器端运行！\n\n[-> 查看可用设置与自定义选项，请参见 Wiki <-](https://github.com/Tschipcraft/spawnanimations/wiki)\n\nv2.0 版本计划引入更复杂的 Animated Java 动画！\n\n\n## 安装说明\n\n安装方式如下：\n\n* **数据包 [DP]** ➜ 将 `.zip` 文件放入世界目录下的 `datapacks` 文件夹中\n* **模组 [Mod]** ➜ 放入 `mods` 文件夹，可选安装 [MidnightLib](https://modrinth.com/project/codAaoxh) 以获取全局配置文件和用户界面\n\n若在 1.20.4 及以下版本中需要隐藏带有自发光材质的实体，并追求更流畅的动画效果，可额外安装 [Pehkui](https://modrinth.com/project/t5W7Jfwy)。\n\n如需管理设置、重置或卸载数据包，请使用命令 `/trigger tschipcraft.menu` 或 `/function #tschipcraft:menu`。\n\n\n## 演示 GIF\n\n<details>\n<summary>点击此处展开</summary>\n<img alt=\"流浪者破土而出\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/X8A0UY9.gif\" width=55%>\n<img alt=\"末影人破土而出\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0rLJakI.gif\" width=55%>\n</details>\n\n\n## 兼容性\n\n<img title=\"Supported Minecraft versions\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?not_updated_versions=1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x&untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=%3C=1.13.x,1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=modrinth\">\n\n**Forge** 原生支持仅至 Minecraft 1.21.5。\n\n适用于 Minecraft 1.14.x、1.15.x 或 1.16.x 的[旧版](https://github.com/Tschipcraft/spawnanimations/tree/master/other_editions)。\n\n如需模组兼容性支持，请参阅 [Fyoncle 制作的 Spawn Animations Compats](https://modrinth.com/datapack/spawn-animations-compats)。\n\n\n## 外部链接\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/spawn-animations\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"CurseForge\" title=\"在 CurseForge 上查看出生动画\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/badges/main/assets/curseforge-modrinth.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/spawn-animations/\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\" title=\"在 PlanetMinecraft 上查看出生动画\" src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-128.png\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/en/spawnanimations.html\">\n<picture>\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/assets/images/logo-black-1.svg\">\n  <img width=\"40px\" title=\"在我的网站上查看出生动画\" src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/C0C5HEJB2\">\n<img width=\"250px\" title=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_red.png\">\n</a>\n\n\n## 合作伙伴优惠\n\n想要购买 **Hytale** 或升级版本？结账时使用创作者代码 `Tschipcraft`，我将获得佣金！（您的价格保持不变）\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2611\">\n<img title=\"通过 Sparked Host 购买服务器支持我（此为推广链接）\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\">\n</a>",
